[
  {
    "text": "If Big Pharma dropped a",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.44
  },
  {
    "text": "pill that cut your risk",
    "start": 1.44,
    "end": 2.72
  },
  {
    "text": "of dying by 12%,",
    "start": 2.72,
    "end": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "and let you stack another",
    "start": 4.52,
    "end": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "12% for every extra pill",
    "start": 6.08,
    "end": 8.18
  },
  {
    "text": "you popped with zero side",
    "start": 8.18,
    "end": 9.58
  },
  {
    "text": "effects,",
    "start": 9.58,
    "end": 9.93
  },
  {
    "text": "how many of it would",
    "start": 10.2,
    "end": 10.96
  },
  {
    "text": "you snag for yourself?",
    "start": 10.96,
    "end": 12.09
  },
  {
    "text": "Well,",
    "start": 12.44,
    "end": 12.950000000000001
  },
  {
    "text": "that drug actually exists.",
    "start": 13.34,
    "end": 14.85
  },
  {
    "text": "The bad news is,",
    "start": 15.4,
    "end": 16.39
  },
  {
    "text": "it doesn't come in a",
    "start": 16.46,
    "end": 17.34
  },
  {
    "text": "bottle,",
    "start": 17.34,
    "end": 17.69
  },
  {
    "text": "so you can't wash it",
    "start": 18.12,
    "end": 19.18
  },
  {
    "text": "down with a nice coffee",
    "start": 19.18,
    "end": 20.26
  },
  {
    "text": "while rotting on the couch.",
    "start": 20.26,
    "end": 21.53
  },
  {
    "text": "It's called walking,",
    "start": 21.88,
    "end": 22.71
  },
  {
    "text": "something your legs were allegedly",
    "start": 23.1,
    "end": 24.5
  },
  {
    "text": "designed to do.",
    "start": 24.5,
    "end": 25.63
  },
  {
    "text": "Researchers tracked people's daily movement",
    "start": 25.88,
    "end": 27.7
  },
  {
    "text": "and split them into groups.",
    "start": 27.7,
    "end": 28.98
  },
  {
    "text": "Starting at the bottom with",
    "start": 28.98,
    "end": 30.52
  },
  {
    "text": "the 3,000 step crowd,",
    "start": 30.52,
    "end": 32.03
  },
  {
    "text": "whose only daily cardio is",
    "start": 32.48,
    "end": 33.88
  },
  {
    "text": "shuffling to the front door",
    "start": 33.88,
    "end": 35.04
  },
  {
    "text": "to grab Uber Eats,",
    "start": 35.04,
    "end": 36.19
  },
  {
    "text": "all the way up to",
    "start": 36.46,
    "end": 37.56
  },
  {
    "text": "the 16,000 step psychopaths,",
    "start": 37.56,
    "end": 39.96
  },
  {
    "text": "who apparently have nowhere to",
    "start": 39.96,
    "end": 41.42
  },
  {
    "text": "sit and zero existential dread",
    "start": 41.42,
    "end": 43.3
  },
  {
    "text": "keeping them horizontal.",
    "start": 43.3,
    "end": 44.39
  },
  {
    "text": "And they found that for",
    "start": 45.1,
    "end": 46.3
  },
  {
    "text": "every extra 1,000 steps someone",
    "start": 46.3,
    "end": 48.32
  },
  {
    "text": "took,",
    "start": 48.32,
    "end": 48.73
  },
  {
    "text": "their risk of dying from",
    "start": 48.9,
    "end": 49.9
  },
  {
    "text": "all causes dropped by 12%.",
    "start": 49.9,
    "end": 52.38
  },
  {
    "text": "Every thousand steps,",
    "start": 52.38,
    "end": 53.65
  },
  {
    "text": "you're basically bribing the Grim",
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 55.62
  },
  {
    "text": "Reaper to look the other",
    "start": 55.62,
    "end": 56.68
  },
  {
    "text": "way.",
    "start": 56.68,
    "end": 56.99
  },
  {
    "text": "But that's not even the",
    "start": 57.18,
    "end": 57.9
  },
  {
    "text": "most offensive part of the",
    "start": 57.9,
    "end": 59.1
  },
  {
    "text": "study.",
    "start": 59.1,
    "end": 59.39
  },
  {
    "text": "When scientists compared the people",
    "start": 59.64,
    "end": 61.04
  },
  {
    "text": "marinating at the bottom to",
    "start": 61.04,
    "end": 62.48
  },
  {
    "text": "the ones at the top,",
    "start": 62.48,
    "end": 63.410000000000004
  },
  {
    "text": "the least active group had",
    "start": 63.62,
    "end": 65.06
  },
  {
    "text": "a 3-fold higher risk of",
    "start": 65.06,
    "end": 66.64
  },
  {
    "text": "death.",
    "start": 66.64,
    "end": 66.99
  },
  {
    "text": "Just to put into perspective",
    "start": 67.28,
    "end": 68.4
  },
  {
    "text": "how absurd that is,",
    "start": 68.4,
    "end": 69.83
  },
  {
    "text": "smoking cigarettes only increases your",
    "start": 69.96,
    "end": 71.96
  },
  {
    "text": "risk of dying by about",
    "start": 71.96,
    "end": 73.04
  },
  {
    "text": "2-fold compared to non-smokers.",
    "start": 73.04,
    "end": 74.94999999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "Let that sink in.",
    "start": 75.4,
    "end": 76.21
  },
  {
    "text": "Statistically,",
    "start": 77.04,
    "end": 77.63
  },
  {
    "text": "rotting in your bed all",
    "start": 77.92,
    "end": 78.94
  },
  {
    "text": "day is more lethal than",
    "start": 78.94,
    "end": 80.46
  },
  {
    "text": "a pack a day habit.",
    "start": 80.46,
    "end": 81.49
  },
  {
    "text": "Your mattress is literally outperforming",
    "start": 82.06,
    "end": 84.74
  },
  {
    "text": "lung cancer.",
    "start": 84.74,
    "end": 85.50999999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "Now,",
    "start": 86.28,
    "end": 86.58999999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm not saying you should",
    "start": 86.8,
    "end": 87.74
  },
  {
    "text": "pick up smoking for your",
    "start": 87.74,
    "end": 88.78
  },
  {
    "text": "health,",
    "start": 88.78,
    "end": 89.11
  },
  {
    "text": "and you definitely don't need",
    "start": 89.48,
    "end": 90.78
  },
  {
    "text": "to march 16,000 steps a",
    "start": 90.78,
    "end": 92.54
  },
  {
    "text": "day like you're fleeing a",
    "start": 92.54,
    "end": 93.62
  },
  {
    "text": "crime scene.",
    "start": 93.62,
    "end": 94.28999999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "The average American barely scrapes",
    "start": 94.46,
    "end": 96.1
  },
  {
    "text": "together 5,000 steps a day.",
    "start": 96.1,
    "end": 97.83
  },
  {
    "text": "And the wild part is,",
    "start": 98.14,
    "end": 99.25
  },
  {
    "text": "even if you just drag",
    "start": 99.36,
    "end": 100.44
  },
  {
    "text": "your carcass from practically decomposing",
    "start": 100.44,
    "end": 102.82
  },
  {
    "text": "down here,",
    "start": 102.82,
    "end": 103.69
  },
  {
    "text": "up to mildly functional right",
    "start": 103.88,
    "end": 105.84
  },
  {
    "text": "about here,",
    "start": 105.84,
    "end": 106.57
  },
  {
    "text": "your risk of dying early",
    "start": 106.78,
    "end": 107.82
  },
  {
    "text": "still plummets by over 50%.",
    "start": 107.82,
    "end": 109.72999999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "You don't need 16,000 steps",
    "start": 110.46,
    "end": 112.64
  },
  {
    "text": "a day to stay alive.",
    "start": 112.64,
    "end": 113.80999999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "But forcing yourself to take",
    "start": 114.32,
    "end": 115.58
  },
  {
    "text": "a walk from wherever you're",
    "start": 115.58,
    "end": 116.84
  },
  {
    "text": "at right now is the",
    "start": 116.84,
    "end": 117.96
  },
  {
    "text": "closest thing you'll ever get",
    "start": 117.96,
    "end": 119.46
  },
  {
    "text": "to this magic pill.",
    "start": 119.46,
    "end": 120.42999999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "Unless you're just really eager",
    "start": 120.8,
    "end": 122.26
  },
  {
    "text": "to let six pallbearers do",
    "start": 122.26,
    "end": 123.68
  },
  {
    "text": "the walking for you.",
    "start": 123.68,
    "end": 124.66999999999999
  }
]